From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.web: JsonArray IVector, JsonObject IMap and their iterators (2012)

windows.web: JsonArray IVector, JsonObject IMap and their iterators (2012)

JsonArray is an IVector and IIterable of its values, JsonObject an IMap and
an IIterable of key/value pairs (in name order); the iterators report
E_CHANGED_STATE once the collection was modified.
---
